{% comment %}
  Crystal Clear Eco Home — The Autonomous Growth Model
  A section detailing the company's business model and scaling strategy.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="eco-section">
  <div class="eco-section__header">
    <h2 class="eco-subtitle">The Autonomous Growth Model</h2>
    <p class="eco-lead">
      Our journey began with a single mission: to create a fully autonomous, low-overhead business model. By removing unnecessary costs, we are able to provide the cheapest-priced eco cleaning service in your city. The following blueprint explains how we achieve this.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="eco-grid eco-grid--3">
    <article class="eco-card">
      <h3 class="eco-card__title">Local Domination</h3>
      <ul class="eco-list">
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>Started with a single city, building a strong local brand.</p></li>
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>Rapidly expanded to cover the entire county and surrounding areas.</p></li>
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>Achieved state-wide saturation in just 6 months.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="eco-card">
      <h3 class="eco-card__title">State-to-State Expansion</h3>
      <ul class="eco-list">
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>A new partner joined us in our mission to open in Dallas, Texas.</p></li>
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>With our replicable model, we covered half of Texas within two months.</p></li>
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>The autonomous, partner-led model proved it could work anywhere.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="eco-card">
      <h3 class="eco-card__title">The 50-State Vision</h3>
      <ul class="eco-list">
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>The success of the Texas launch confirmed our belief in the model.</p></li>
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>We realized this autonomously operated business model could be replicated across all 50 states.</p></li>
        <li><span class="eco-dot"></span><p>Our mission is to bring affordable, eco-friendly cleaning to the entire nation.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* Eco Glassmorphism Style */
@charset "UTF-8";

/* Color custom properties */
:root {
  --color-base-background: 186, 192, 149;
  --color-foreground: #f8f8f8;
  --color-foreground-title: #f8f8f8;
  --color-foreground-secondary: #e0e0e0;
  --color-link: #49633e;
  --color-button: #49633e;
  --color-button-text: #fff;
  --color-badge-background: #49633e;
  --color-badge-border: #49633e;
  --color-text-light: #eaf5e3;
  --color-text-dark: #0d0d0d;
}

/* Text and section styling */
.eco-section {
  background-color: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.75);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  border-radius: 16px;
  margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  text-align: center;
}

.eco-section:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
}

/* Headings and text colors */
.eco-title, .eco-subtitle, .eco-card__title, .eco-lead, .eco-list p {
  color: #f8f8f8;
  font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  text-shadow: none;
  margin: 0;
}

.eco-title {
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
}

.eco-subtitle {
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 36px);
}

.eco-card__title {
  font-weight: 900;
  font-size: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 24px);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  text-align: left;
}

.eco-lead {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 1rem auto 0;
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* Badges */
.eco-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  background: var(--color-badge-background);
  color: var(--color-button-text);
}

/* Grid for cards */
.eco-grid {
  display: grid;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  justify-content: center;
}

.eco-grid--3 {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .eco-grid--3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
}

.eco-grid--2 {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .eco-grid--2 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

/* Cards (now transparent) */
.eco-card {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  text-align: left;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
  box-shadow: none;
}

.eco-card:hover {
  transform: none;
  box-shadow: none;
}

/* Lists and dots */
.eco-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  color: #e0e0e0;
}

.eco-list li {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 20px 1fr;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.eco-list p {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--color-foreground-secondary);
}

.eco-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: #f8f8f8;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  animation: pulse-light 2s ease-out infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse-light {
  0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(248, 248, 248, 0.4); }
  70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(248, 248, 248, 0); }
  100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(248, 248, 248, 0); }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Autonomy",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "The Autonomous Growth Model"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}